<title>USA: Schawk Inc acquires StanMont Inc.</title>
<headline>Schawk Inc acquires StanMont Inc.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schawk Inc said Tuesday it has completed the acquisition of StanMont Inc, a Montreal-based imaging products producer.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. StanMont had $20 million in revenues in 1995.</p>
<p>Schawk has imaging products, packaging and filtration device units. Its stock was down 1/8 at 7-1/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
